<title>USA: NationsBank declines comment on rumors.</title>
<headline>NationsBank declines comment on rumors.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBank Corp Thursday declined comment on rumors that it was close to a deal to buy Montgomery Securities for $1 billion.</p>
<p>Cable channel CNBC had reported that a deal would be announced soon.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for San Francisco-based Montgomery also declined comment.</p>
<p>&quot;We have not made an announcement, we have no comment at this time,&quot; a NationsBank spokeswoman said. She said NationsBank has a policy of not commenting on speculation.</p>
<p>NationsBank was off one to 66-5/8. Montgomery Securities is a closely held firm.</p>
</text>
